C('FUTURE.S110_counts','All six ephemerides: 8 A mid-times between sector start and 2026-11-26 00:00 UTC, 9th at 14:47-14:49 UTC; A n=113 wholly in the 11-13 19:55-11-14 00:55 gap (ingress 24 min after gap start, egress 164 min before gap end, vs sigma <=4.4 min; margin survives even if science stops 10 min before contact); 5 A in listed segments; 3 B, none in a gap. The 11-20 06:01 A event and the 11-23 B event depend on the unpublished final segment start (assumed ~11-20 01:45 by analogy).','verify/s110_indep.json gap_margin_A113_U_min; '+W+'s110_predict.json ephemerides.*.counts; '+W+'web/TESS_orbit_times.csv L334-L336'),
