out=dict(topic='T7_data_future - Data products, search facts, novelty and Sector 110 (verification)',
 summary='All 21 FINAL facts and all 10 RESOLVED conflicts (plus cosmetic X-T7-05) are confirmed. An independent S110 rerun using a separately coded Roemer delay reproduces every predicted A and B time for all six ephemerides to 1 s. It confirms the ephemeris-independent counts (8 or 9 A, 3 B) and puts A n=113 wholly inside the official 11-13/14 gap, with 24 min to spare against sigma of 4.4 min or less. The ExoFOP 8148/5137 data-row counts were rechecked from the audit files. The QLP header, the MAST page, DRN004 and Crossref support "TGLC-based photometry" with Petitpas2026. Three things were missed, none blocking: S98 is a 57-d double sector; 126,070 of the 126,246 input stars were searchable; and in leo_rerun.json the key B_pipeline_ephemeris holds MES 12.11 with A masked, while the pipeline-matching 10.975 is under _nomask.',
 verdicts=verdicts+conf, missed=missed, manuscript_findings=mf,
 files_written=[W+'verify/s110_indep.py',W+'verify/s110_indep.json',W+'verify/s110_indep.log',W+'verify/build_verify.py',W+'verify/verify.json'])
